{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the statements: \n\\begin{align}\n&amp;I: (\\sqrt{-4})(\\sqrt {-16}) = \\sqrt{(-4)(-16)}, \\\\\n&amp;II: \\sqrt{(-4)(-16)} = \\sqrt{64}, \\\\\n&amp;III: \\sqrt{64} = 8.\n\\end{align}\nOf these the following are incorrect. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45ddf85a18ed86cf7b899671266b51f124014081.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{none} \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ \\text{I only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ \\text{II only} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ \\text{III only}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ \\text{I and III only}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"609\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Statement I is incorrect, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a9793fd05f69588fb23b47a8ce36dd7247210f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{-4})(\\sqrt{-16})=(i\\sqrt{4})(i\\sqrt{16})=i^2(\\sqrt{4})(\\sqrt{16})=-\\sqrt{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"434\" height=\"24\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\nStatement II is correct, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56defb304acc922ce69abefaca3ac72e404d1d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-4)(-16)=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59b230acbddfe6f299d0e7e15b9f9421b8e2d27b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(-4)(-16)}=\\sqrt{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"161\" height=\"35\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\nStatement III is correct, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/3/f23a12c63e2c87ce259966d42fe9a7f01c7f627e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^2=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a61b0d2ff8b06925d1306eca2368197d2df7508.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> (so it is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square_root\" title=\"Square root\">principal square root</a> of 64). <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\nThus, only statement I is incorrect, so we choose answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid bl